    "_va1r_note": "va1 recipe on the unchanged new architecture (Astra 16/09, desktop chat): question -> final JSON, final=1, no bin reading, no auxiliary bin losses, no intermediate reasoning; 5 epochs, batch 1 (accumulation 1 -> 22440 optimizer steps), LoRA and frontend at 1e-4 like va1, wd 0.01, warmup 3%. Clean start: pretrained Qwen plus freshly initialised modules. Documented deviations: decorrelation_weight stays 0.01 (frontend regulariser added in P1-b against scale collapse, not a bin objective; removing it reintroduces a known failure mode) and selection is by validation direct primary instead of va1's validation loss.",
    "header_stats": "eth",
    "_va1rz_note": "Raw-header arm (Jacopo 17/09). NO number computed from the signal reaches the text: the prompt keeps only the recording length, dt, channel names and the token count per channel. Verified 17/09 that the statistics header is OURS -- AnomalyXL supplies no statistics, va1's prompt is system + 'The following is channel X:' + embeddings + question, TimeRLM's is an agentic code prompt. So this arm RESTORES va1's input condition rather than ablating it, and makes our numbers comparable with va1 on the same dataset. Hypothesis under test (Jacopo): in the first epochs the model overfits the header, attention shifts away from the temporal embeddings, and by epochs 3-5 those embeddings no longer carry enough weight to change the answer; with no statistics in the text that shift cannot happen. Note: va1rh (min/max removed) killed measure_magnitude 0.7377->0.0471 and lifted lead_lag 0.0000->0.3600, but did NOT produce localisation, so removing the shortcut is necessary and not sufficient.",
    "_va1ethpos_note": "Fable 18/09: la posizione raggiunge il LM solo come uno scalare a guadagno 0,25 (META_GAIN) piu' una fase RoPE che la wildcard cancella nelle coppie testo-segnale, quindi non esiste una forma copiabile di 'dove' e produrre cifre da uno scalare e' aritmetica non lineare. va1, l'unico sistema che abbia localizzato in vista globale (IoU 0,094 sui positivi senza header), mette nel token 16 frequenze di Fourier della posizione (wavelet_encoder.py, 'value scalar + fourier positions'). Questo braccio ripristina quella codifica a guadagno pieno, calcolata in float64 perche' 2^15*pi radianti non sopravvivono a bf16. Tutto il resto identico a va1rz/va1eth: prompt ETH verbatim, nessuna statistica nel testo, nessuna supervisione per token."
  },
